<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1109] Dialog is displayed multiple times</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1109</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Bootstrap dialog is being used in many places. For instance, &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;to confirm notebook removal when notebook delete button click&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;to confirm save when interpreter setting change&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;and so on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Bootstrap dialog is animated down from the top, when it is being displayed.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;User sometimes press &apos;enter&apos; key before animation is completed.&lt;br/&gt;
In this case, instead of pressing &apos;OK&apos; button in the dialog, it creates dialog again.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;see attached gif&lt;/p&gt;</description>
